Good morning Robert,



Couple things based on your comments:



Line 48 SST Transformer- Change qty to 1 (saving  87k)  This contradicts the scope of work.  Is this being changed or updated?  We cannot just remove the cost if it doesn't align with the scope.

Line 62 Misc Eqt and Construction Actuals delete all  (saving 609K)  Please see attached - The $609k is an actual charged in Power Plan.  This cannot be removed from the cost estimate.  Suggest looking into what the charges are for.

Line 66 Relays delete line entirely (savins 1.5M)  This cost is assumed from the original quote for the BESS and not part of the feeder protection.  I do not believe these to be duplicates and need to be apart of the assumed BESS costs.



With what you have mentioned, I do not see any changes needed unless there is a better understanding as to why or what supports the ask.  We can talk through the assumed quote used for the BESS or if your Project Cost Analyst digs into the actual charges to the project, but as of right now, we can't agree with these changes.



